{"title": "Battlemage's Power", "pageid": 28975, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Battlemage's_Power", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Battlemage's Power</b> is a passive feature that enhances the user's spellcasting whenever they damage a foe with a weapon attack spell.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When you hit a target with a spell or cantrip that uses a weapon, you gain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Acuity_(Condition)\" title=\"Arcane Acuity (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/37/Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/37/Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/37/Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arcane Acuity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/37/Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/37/Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Acuity_(Condition)\" title=\"Arcane Acuity (Condition)\">Arcane Acuity</a>. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Per attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Per attack</dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Arcane_Acuity\"> Condition: Arcane Acuity </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Acuity_(Condition)\" title=\"Arcane Acuity (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/37/Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/37/Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/37/Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arcane Acuity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/37/Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/37/Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Acuity_(Condition)\" title=\"Arcane Acuity (Condition)\">Arcane Acuity</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity has a +1 bonus to its <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">spell</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throw#The_Difficulty_Class_of_saving_throws\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving throw\">spell save DC</a> for each remaining turn.</li>\n<li>Reduce the duration by 2 each time the entity takes damage.</li>\n<li><b>Arcane Acuity</b> has a maximum <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 10 turns.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gloves_of_Battlemage%27s_Power\" title=\"Gloves of Battlemage's Power\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Gloves_Metal_I_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Metal_I_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Gloves_Metal_I_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Gloves_Metal_I_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Gloves_Metal_I_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Gloves_Metal_I_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Gloves_Metal_I_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Metal_I_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Gloves_Metal_I_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Gloves_of_Battlemage%27s_Power\" title=\"Gloves of Battlemage's Power\">Gloves of Battlemage's Power</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The spells that can trigger this effect are:\n<ul><li>Any <a href=\"/wiki/Smite\" title=\"Smite\">smite</a> spell (and also <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Smite\" title=\"Divine Smite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp/20px-Divine_Smite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp/30px-Divine_Smite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp/40px-Divine_Smite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Divine Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp/20px-Divine_Smite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Smite\" title=\"Divine Smite\">Divine Smite</a>). Casting a smite spell and then reacting with Divine Smite will trigger Battlemage's Power twice.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Booming_Blade\" title=\"Booming Blade\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp/20px-Booming_Blade_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp/30px-Booming_Blade_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp/40px-Booming_Blade_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Booming Blade\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp/20px-Booming_Blade_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Booming_Blade\" title=\"Booming Blade\">Booming Blade</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ensnaring_Strike_(Melee)\" title=\"Ensnaring Strike (Melee)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Ensnaring_Strike_Melee_Icon.webp/20px-Ensnaring_Strike_Melee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Ensnaring_Strike_Melee_Icon.webp/30px-Ensnaring_Strike_Melee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Ensnaring_Strike_Melee_Icon.webp/40px-Ensnaring_Strike_Melee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ensnaring Strike (Melee)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Ensnaring_Strike_Melee_Icon.webp/20px-Ensnaring_Strike_Melee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/50/Ensnaring_Strike_Melee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ensnaring_Strike_(Melee)\" title=\"Ensnaring Strike (Melee)\">Ensnaring Strike (Melee)</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ensnaring_Strike_(Ranged)\" title=\"Ensnaring Strike (Ranged)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp/20px-Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp/30px-Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp/40px-Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ensnaring Strike (Ranged)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp/20px-Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ensnaring_Strike_(Ranged)\" title=\"Ensnaring Strike (Ranged)\">Ensnaring Strike (Ranged)</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hail_of_Thorns\" title=\"Hail of Thorns\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Hail_of_Thorns_Icon.webp/20px-Hail_of_Thorns_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/63/Hail_of_Thorns_Icon.webp/30px-Hail_of_Thorns_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/63/Hail_of_Thorns_Icon.webp/40px-Hail_of_Thorns_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hail of Thorns\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Hail_of_Thorns_Icon.webp/20px-Hail_of_Thorns_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Hail_of_Thorns_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hail_of_Thorns\" title=\"Hail of Thorns\">Hail of Thorns</a></li>\n<li>Any damage dealt while wielding a normal, non-permanent <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Blade\" title=\"Flame Blade\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/20px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/30px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/40px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Flame Blade\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/20px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Blade\" title=\"Flame Blade\">Flame Blade</a> in the main hand. The damage can be from any source such as weapon attacks, spell damage (including each dart from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Missile\" title=\"Magic Missile\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/20px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/30px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/40px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Missile\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/20px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Missile\" title=\"Magic Missile\">Magic Missile</a>), or even damage from status effects like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\">Burning</a>. Battlemage's Power does not trigger if the conjured weapon is in the off-hand, even if attacking with the conjured weapon.</li>\n<li>Weapon attacks with <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Blade_(weapon)\" title=\"Shadow Blade (weapon)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Shadow_Blade_Icon.png/20px-Shadow_Blade_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Shadow_Blade_Icon.png/30px-Shadow_Blade_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Shadow_Blade_Icon.png/40px-Shadow_Blade_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Shadow_Blade_Icon.png/20px-Shadow_Blade_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Shadow_Blade_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Blade_(weapon)\" title=\"Shadow Blade (weapon)\">Shadow Blade (weapon)</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The reader is advised that Battlemage's Power appears to have some of the most complex and unintuitive behaviour in the game, making it difficult to distinguish what is actually a bug.\n<ul><li>Any damage dealt while wielding a normal, non-permanent Flame Blade in the main hand triggers Battlemage's Power. The damage can be from any source such as weapon attacks, spell damage (including each dart from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Missile\" title=\"Magic Missile\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/20px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/30px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/40px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Missile\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/20px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Missile\" title=\"Magic Missile\">Magic Missile</a> and each blast from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Blast\" title=\"Eldritch Blast\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/db/Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp/20px-Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/db/Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp/30px-Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/db/Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp/40px-Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Eldritch Blast\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/db/Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp/20px-Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/db/Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Blast\" title=\"Eldritch Blast\">Eldritch Blast</a>), or even damage from status effects like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\">Burning</a>. Battlemage's Power does not trigger if the conjured weapons are in the off-hand, even if attacking with the conjured weapon. This only works with a normal, temporary Flame Blade summoned by the corresponding spell and not with a permanent Flame Blade acquired through <a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Blade#Bugs\" title=\"Flame Blade\">hireling exploit</a>. This effect also used to work while wielding a Shadow Blade in the main hand, but this was removed in a hotfix after Patch 8.</li>\n<li>Battlemage's Power does not function with the <a href=\"/wiki/Mephistopheles_Tiefling\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mephistopheles Tiefling\">Mephistopheles Tiefling</a> version of Flame Blade, as this version has a different condition applied to it which is not listed in the <code>ArcaneAcuityGlovesCondition() .khn</code> script.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/30px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/40px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Throwing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">Throwing</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Potions#Healing_Potions\" title=\"Potions\">Healing Potions</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Grenades\" title=\"Grenades\">Grenades</a> triggers Battlemage's Power, even without hitting any target.</li>\n<li>Reaction Smites provide acuity if and only if the triggering attack provided acuity. If the source attack does trigger Battlemage's Power, reaction smite triggers them a second time, for a total of +4 Acuity.</li>\n<li>All of the following provide Acuity:\n<ul><li>Persistent AoE spell effects like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cloudkill\" title=\"Cloudkill\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Cloudkill_Icon.webp/20px-Cloudkill_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Cloudkill_Icon.webp/30px-Cloudkill_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Cloudkill_Icon.webp/40px-Cloudkill_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cloudkill\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Cloudkill_Icon.webp/20px-Cloudkill_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/Cloudkill_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cloudkill\" title=\"Cloudkill\">Cloudkill</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wall_of_Fire\" title=\"Wall of Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Wall_of_Fire_Icon.webp/20px-Wall_of_Fire_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Wall_of_Fire_Icon.webp/30px-Wall_of_Fire_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Wall_of_Fire_Icon.webp/40px-Wall_of_Fire_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wall of Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Wall_of_Fire_Icon.webp/20px-Wall_of_Fire_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Wall_of_Fire_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wall_of_Fire\" title=\"Wall of Fire\">Wall of Fire</a></li>\n<li>Every status in the game which deals damage attributed to the wearer triggers Battlemage's Power. For example, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\">Burning</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Electrocuted_(Condition)\" title=\"Electrocuted (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cd/Electrocuted_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Electrocuted_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cd/Electrocuted_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Electrocuted_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cd/Electrocuted_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Electrocuted_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Electrocuted\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cd/Electrocuted_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Electrocuted_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cd/Electrocuted_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Electrocuted_(Condition)\" title=\"Electrocuted (Condition)\">Electrocuted</a>.</li>\n<li>Fall damage caused by the wearer</li>\n<li>Some miscellaneous effects like the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Holy_Lance_Helm\" title=\"Holy Lance Helm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Holy_Lance_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Holy_Lance_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Holy_Lance_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Holy_Lance_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Holy_Lance_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Holy_Lance_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Holy_Lance_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Holy_Lance_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/Holy_Lance_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Holy_Lance_Helm\" title=\"Holy Lance Helm\">Holy Lance Helm</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>Retaliation effects do not trigger Battlemage's Power.\n<ul><li>This includes <code>onHit</code> effects such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_Agathys\" title=\"Armour of Agathys\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp/20px-Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/77/Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp/30px-Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/77/Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp/40px-Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour of Agathys\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp/20px-Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/77/Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_Agathys\" title=\"Armour of Agathys\">Armour of Agathys</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Shield\" title=\"Fire Shield\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Fire_Shield_Icon.webp/20px-Fire_Shield_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Fire_Shield_Icon.webp/30px-Fire_Shield_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Fire_Shield_Icon.webp/40px-Fire_Shield_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire Shield\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Fire_Shield_Icon.webp/20px-Fire_Shield_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Fire_Shield_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Shield\" title=\"Fire Shield\">Fire Shield</a>; <code>onDamage</code> effects such as <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fleshmelter_Cloak\" title=\"Fleshmelter Cloak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f7/Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fleshmelter_Cloak\" title=\"Fleshmelter Cloak\">Fleshmelter Cloak</a>; and <code>onMiss</code> effects such as <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_of_Scorching_Reprisal\" title=\"Shield of Scorching Reprisal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Metal_Shield_Flaming_Fist_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Metal_Shield_Flaming_Fist_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Metal_Shield_Flaming_Fist_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Metal_Shield_Flaming_Fist_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Metal_Shield_Flaming_Fist_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Metal_Shield_Flaming_Fist_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Metal_Shield_Flaming_Fist_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Metal_Shield_Flaming_Fist_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9b/Metal_Shield_Flaming_Fist_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shield_of_Scorching_Reprisal\" title=\"Shield of Scorching Reprisal\">Shield of Scorching Reprisal</a>.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Battlemage's Power is meant to have a <code>OncePerAttack</code> restriction, meaning they should only provide Acuity once per damaging event. However, the OncePerAttack limit gets reset every time the player character performs any effect which targets any in-game entity, whether that entity is an enemy, an ally, or the wearer themself.\n<ul><li>This includes regular attacks as well as self-target abilities like <a href=\"/wiki/Dash\" title=\"Dash\">Dash</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Rage\" title=\"Rage\">Rage</a>.</li>\n<li>This also includes effects the game considers an \"attack\" (due to underlying code) such as: using the Perform action (including in combat), speaking with the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\" style=\"width: 20px; height: 20px; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sentient_Amulet\" title=\"Sentient Amulet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sentient_Amulet\" title=\"Sentient Amulet\">Sentient Amulet</a> (including in combat), targeting someone with the ability check version of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bend_Luck\" title=\"Bend Luck\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Bend_Luck_Icon.webp/20px-Bend_Luck_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Bend_Luck_Icon.webp/30px-Bend_Luck_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Bend_Luck_Icon.webp/40px-Bend_Luck_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bend Luck\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Bend_Luck_Icon.webp/20px-Bend_Luck_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Bend_Luck_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bend_Luck\" title=\"Bend Luck\">Bend Luck</a>, and provoking an attack of opportunity (though if the wearer takes damage from it, they lose 2 Acuity).</li></ul></li>\n<li>Explosions also reset the gloves' once per attack limit. This includes the AOE \"explosions\" from <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hamarhraft\" title=\"Hamarhraft\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Hamarhraft_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Hamarhraft_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Hamarhraft_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Hamarhraft_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Hamarhraft_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Hamarhraft_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Hamarhraft_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Hamarhraft_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ab/Hamarhraft_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hamarhraft\" title=\"Hamarhraft\">Hamarhraft</a> and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Luminous_Armour\" title=\"Luminous Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Luminous_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Luminous_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Luminous_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Luminous_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Luminous_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Luminous_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Luminous_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Luminous_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6b/Luminous_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Luminous_Armour\" title=\"Luminous Armour\">Luminous Armour</a> as well as grenades like <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alchemist%27s_Fire\" title=\"Alchemist's Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/29/GRN_Alchemist%27s_Fire_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-GRN_Alchemist%27s_Fire_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/29/GRN_Alchemist%27s_Fire_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-GRN_Alchemist%27s_Fire_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/29/GRN_Alchemist%27s_Fire_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-GRN_Alchemist%27s_Fire_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/29/GRN_Alchemist%27s_Fire_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-GRN_Alchemist%27s_Fire_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/29/GRN_Alchemist%27s_Fire_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemist%27s_Fire\" title=\"Alchemist's Fire\">Alchemist's Fire</a> and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Caustic_Bulb\" title=\"Caustic Bulb\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/GRN_Caustic_Bulb_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-GRN_Caustic_Bulb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/GRN_Caustic_Bulb_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-GRN_Caustic_Bulb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/GRN_Caustic_Bulb_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-GRN_Caustic_Bulb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/GRN_Caustic_Bulb_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-GRN_Caustic_Bulb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/GRN_Caustic_Bulb_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Caustic_Bulb\" title=\"Caustic Bulb\">Caustic Bulb</a>.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<p>From the definition of <code>ArcaneAcuityGlovesCondition()</code> in <code>Mods/Shared/Scripts/thoth/helpers/CommonConditions.khn</code>:\n</p><details class=\"details--root wikicollapse\"><summary>Show code</summary>\n\n<pre>function ArcaneAcuityGlovesCondition()\n\treturn IsSmiteSpells()\n\t| SpellId('Target_BoomingBlade_ClassSpell')\n\t| IsSpellChildOrVariantFromContext('Target_BoomingBlade_ClassSpell')\n\t| SpellId('Target_BoomingBlade')\n\t| IsSpellChildOrVariantFromContext('Target_BoomingBlade')\n\t| SpellId('Target_EnsnaringStrike')\n\t| SpellId('Projectile_EnsnaringStrike')\n\t| IsSpellChildOrVariantFromContext('Target_EnsnaringStrike')\n\t| IsSpellChildOrVariantFromContext('Projectile_EnsnaringStrike')\n\t| SpellId('Projectile_HailOfThorns')\n\t| IsSpellChildOrVariantFromContext('Projectile_HailOfThorns')\n\t| HasStatus('FLAME_BLADE',GetActiveWeapon()) \n\t| HasStatus('FLAME_BLADE_4',GetActiveWeapon())\n\t| HasStatus('FLAME_BLADE_6',GetActiveWeapon())\n\t| HasStatus('SHADOW_BLADE',GetActiveWeapon())\n\t| (IsSpell() &amp; IsWeaponAttack())\nend\n</pre></details>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195238\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.160 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.178 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 9416/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 90375/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 42828/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 1/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 969/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.099/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 994872/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  149.112      1 -total\n 99.91%  148.982      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 29.01%   43.258      9 Template:SmRarityItem\n 28.98%   43.216     10 Template:Item_icon\n 23.72%   35.375     21 Template:Icon_link\n 23.51%   35.062     22 Template:Icon_text\n 23.33%   34.783    104 Template:Trim\n 22.03%   32.849      5 Template:SmCond\n 21.50%   32.057     15 Template:SmSAI\n 11.75%   17.524     42 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28975-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195238 and revision id 392652. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}